Package: nautilus-new-named-document
Version: 1.2.0
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3-nautilus (>= 4.0), zenity, xdg-user-dirs, libglib2.0-bin, procps
Maintainer: Kovo <kovo.mato@gmail.com>
Description: Nautilus "New Document" menu that asks for the file name
 Replaces the "New Document" submenu of GNOME Files (Nautilus) with one
 that asks for the file name before the file is created. Works right
 after installation; Files is restarted automatically.
